                    X_{cof}
                    \&amp;\overset{\in Cof}{\longrightarrow}&amp;
                    (X_{cof})^{fib}
                    \\\
                    {}^{\mathllap{\in W \cap Fib}}\downarrow
                    \&amp;&amp;
                    \\downarrow^{\mathrlap{\in W \cap Fib}}
                    \\\
                    X
                    \&amp;\underset{\in W Cof}{\longrightarrow}&amp;
