                    \\,.
            %p
              But now since the vertical morphisms are weak equivalences, this means that already the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fibrant+replacement"} fibrant replacement
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                    %mo →
                    %msup
                      %mi X
