                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X \to X^{fib}
              is isomorphic, in the
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+category+of+a+model+category"} homotopy category
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/derived+adjunction+unit"} derived adjunction unit
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/localization"} localization
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ℓ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \ell
              to the above diagram in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝒞
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{C}
              yields the diagram
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mrow
