            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/arrow+category"} arrow category
            of
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi C
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} C
          %p
            By the general
            %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/accessible+category#Properties"} properties of accessible categories
            for that it is sufficient to exhibit
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
