          %h3#further_properties_2 Further properties
          .num_lemmaa
            %h6#lemma_localization_at_cofibrations_is_sufficient Lemma (localization at cofibrations is sufficient)
            %p
              Every combinatorial localization
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi B
                    %mo =
                    %msub
